<title>THAILAND: Thailand revises upwards 1997/98 first rice crop.</title>
<headline>Thailand revises upwards 1997/98 first rice crop.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Agriculture Ministry on Monday revised the forecast for the country's 1997/98 first rice crop up to 18.18 million tonnes from 18.14 million tonnes seen earlier.</p>
</text>
